5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to be thorough about the costs and the risks of late cancellations. I'll look into the quoting terms for whole-building lets and the group transport receipts from the last three years.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to ensure the quality of the stay doesn't compromise our training. I'll check the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the vacation timetable for the club's own hall.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to make sure the people organizing this don't have to work too hard. I'll look into the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, and the lottery for public group bookings.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll check the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds and the attendance sheets for the away camps. I want to get a clearer picture of the actual costs and who is participating.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'll look into what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the membership list against first-train times. We need a place where everyone actually bonds and can actually show up.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Since everyone has already selected their two items, I believe we have a comprehensive plan for this round. I'll wait for the results to see how they impact our budget and logistics.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,Agreed. There is no need to overlap our efforts. Let's see what the data reveals before we start debating the specific destination.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I agree. I hope the information helps us find a place where everyone can relax and enjoy themselves without too much stress for the organizers.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's proceed to the investigation phase. I'll be interested to see if the attendance numbers align with the costs we're projecting.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm with you. Let's just make sure we don't ignore the human side of this. I'll be waiting to see if the data supports a place that actually brings us together.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
